## 7. Összefoglaló — mi van benne

| Funkció | API | Státusz |
|---|---|---|
| Home Screen install prompt | `beforeinstallprompt` | ✅ Android + banner iOS |
| iOS "Add to Home Screen" útmutató | `navigator.standalone` | ✅ |
| Splash screen minden iPhone/iPad | `apple-touch-startup-image` | ✅ |
| Safe area (Dynamic Island, home bar) | `env(safe-area-inset-*)` | ✅ |
| Push értesítések | `PushManager` + VAPID | ✅ iOS 16.4+ |
| App badge | `navigator.setAppBadge` | ✅ |
| Background Sync | `SyncManager` | ✅ |
| Periodic Background Sync | `PeriodicSyncManager` | ✅ |
| Screen Wake Lock | `navigator.wakeLock` | ✅ |
| Web Share | `navigator.share` | ✅ |
| Share Target (beérkező share) | manifest + SW | ✅ |
| File Handling | `launchQueue` | ✅ |
| Protocol Handler | `web+agent://` | ✅ |
| App Shortcuts | manifest shortcuts | ✅ |
| Offline fallback | Service Worker | ✅ |
| SW update toast | `updatefound` event | ✅ |
| Window Controls Overlay | manifest + CSS | ✅ |
| Keyboard shortcuts | `keydown` | ✅ |
| Network status UI | `online`/`offline` events | ✅ |
| Orientation lock | `screen.orientation.lock` | ✅ |
| Haptic feedback | `navigator.vibrate` | ✅ |
| IndexedDB offline queue | `indexedDB` | ✅ |
| Reduced motion | CSS media query | ✅ |
| Dark/light mode | CSS media query | ✅ |
| Tablet split layout | CSS + display-mode | ✅ |

A VAPID kulcsodat a `'YOUR_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY_HERE'` helyére kell beírni, a splashscreen PNG-ket a megfelelő méretekben elő kell készíteni.[1][2][3]
